#decision("Safety and security rules live in code, not only in the prompt")[
*Options:* prompt the model to be safe, or enforce safety in code. *Choice:* code: prompt injection ranks first among LLM application risks << cite('owasp_llm_top10_2026') >> and injected text can steer a model << cite('greshake_2023') >>, so notes, complaints and photo text are data, the model's tools act only on the session and safety records come only from the forms. *Consequence:* the same warnings, refusals and locks in every mode.
